# Pre-commit

Before committing, run `just fix`, then `just check`.

`just fix` applies the automatic fixes. Stage those edits.

`just check` only reports. When it fails, fix what it reports, then run `just fix` and `just check` again. Commit only after `just check` succeeds.


# Commit message

Do not add cursor account user name or email to the commit message.

Use "Sai Jonnala <jspreddy@users.noreply.github.com>"